  "notes": [
    "Values are overall winter loss rate (%) = mortality + queen problems + natural disasters",
    "95% CI from published tables; null where not reported",
    "n_colonies = colonies going into winter",
    "UK is split into England (ENG), Scotland (SCT), Wales (WLS), Northern Ireland (NIR) per COLOSS methodology",
    "Germany 2016-17 uses the larger DIB survey (n=149,417 colonies)",
    "USA data is winter loss from BIP/AIA, different methodology than COLOSS",
    "Netherlands 2017-18 excluded: only mortality rate published, no overall loss rate",
    "EPILOBEE 2012-13 and 2013-14: unweighted apiary-level means from raw active surveillance data; different methodology from COLOSS questionnaire surveys; no 95% CI available",
    "ENGLAND & WALES combined as ENG in EPILOBEE data (per original dataset grouping)"
